      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02066",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“不是。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02066",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我觉得只要因为有新恋情，而对旧恋情有半点冷却，那就不应该有新恋情。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I think that if a new love makes the old love cool even a little, then there should be no new love.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02066",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "只有这种女人才不能把新恋情向旧恋人坦率地说出来。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Only that kind of woman cannot frankly tell her former lover about a new love.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
